 R←Test_SendEmail_59(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;class;ref;results;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ `Connection.CongaRef` pointing to a Conga namespace, by name and by reference
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 class←SMTP.Connection
 results←⍬
 :For ref :In (⍕Conga)Conga
     class.LDRC←''
     class.CongaRef←ref
     (rc msg log text)←∆Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
     results,←rc
 :EndFor
 class.LDRC←''
 class.CongaRef←''
 →T.PassesIf 0 0≡results

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
